  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "おおむかしに　とある　ポケモンの\nちからを　ふうじこめたと　される　ツボ。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "먼 옛날 어떤 포켓몬의 힘을\n봉인했다고 여겨지는 항아리.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "據說在很久以前封印著\n某隻寶可夢力量的壺。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Récipient utilisé il y a fort longtemps pour sceller\nle pouvoir d’un certain Pokémon.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ein Gefäß, mit dem vor langer, langer Zeit die Macht\neines gewissen Pokémon versiegelt wurde.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Vasija en la que se halla confinado el poder de\ncierto Pokémon desde hace muchísimo tiempo.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Vaso in cui si dice sia sigillata da tempo\nimmemorabile la forza di un Pokémon.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A bottle believed to have been used to seal away\nthe power of a certain Pokémon long, long ago.",
